    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44ab6de4a8286f5ef428dc3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹今天的表现\n少了平时的利落感。\n没能正常发挥实力的原因应该是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b7e400adcc4f122a9039a1eff8213eca56608e6cc8e42cf5aecb22ffc9abb45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067318.json",
