    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7364502e5a530e0738d9792a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "深藏着坚定不可动摇意志的她，\n给人一种甚至能颠覆不可能的能量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4c4dd7c21321f9d60c2ee71c88b4e7891e59e62894e8a3f926e60a7603824d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
